Description: Fix GHSA-jm82-fx9c-mx94 (CWE-400) memory exhaustion when parsing PDF
 streams declared without an explicit /Length value. Apply
 MAX_DECLARED_STREAM_LENGTH to streams without length as well, and add length
 limits to NumberObject, NameObject and ContentStream parsing paths to prevent
 unbounded memory allocation from crafted input.
Origin: upstream, https://github.com/py-pdf/pypdf/commit/e7249787be367fc78818b1f7085d21ff22f24d71
Bug: https://github.com/py-pdf/pypdf/security/advisories/GHSA-jm82-fx9c-mx94
Bug: https://github.com/py-pdf/pypdf/pull/3871
Author: pypdf maintainers
Last-Update: 2026-06-29

